{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 10,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.10.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.10.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Why standest thou afar off, O Jehovah?\nWhy hidest thou thyself in times of trouble?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.10.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.10.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In the pride of the wicked the poor is hotly pursued;Let them be taken in the devices that they have conceived.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.10.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.10.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the wicked boasteth of his heart’s desire,\nAnd the covetous renounceth, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "yea",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", contemneth Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.10.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.10.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wicked, in the pride of his countenance, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "saith",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", He will not require ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\nAll his thoughts are, There is no God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.10.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.10.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "His ways are firm at all times;\nThy judgments are far above out of his sight:\nAs for all his adversaries, he puffeth at them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.10.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.10.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He saith in his heart, I shall not be moved;\nTo all generations I shall not be in adversity.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.10.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.10.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "His mouth is full of cursing and deceit and oppression:\nUnder his tongue is mischief and iniquity.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.10.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.10.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He sitteth in the lurking-places of the villages;\nIn the secret places doth he murder the innocent;\nHis eyes are privily set against the helpless.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.10.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.10.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He lurketh in secret as a lion in his covert;\nHe lieth in wait to catch the poor:\nHe doth catch the poor, when he draweth him in his net.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.10.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.10.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He croucheth, he boweth down,\nAnd the helpless fall by his strong ones.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.10.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.10.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He saith in his heart: God hath forgotten;\nHe hideth his face, he will never see it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.10.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.10.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Arise, O Jehovah; O God, lift up thy hand:\nForget not the poor.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.10.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.10.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore doth the wicked contemn God,\nAnd say in his heart, Thou wilt not require ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.10.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.10.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou hast seen ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "; for thou beholdest mischief and spite, to requite it with thy hand:\nThe helpless committeth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "himself",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unto thee;\nThou hast been the helper of the fatherless.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.10.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.10.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Break thou the arm of the wicked;\nAnd as for the evil man, seek out his wickedness till thou find none.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.10.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.10.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah is King for ever and ever:\nThe nations are perished out of his land.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.10.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.10.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah, thou hast heard the desire of the meek:\nThou wilt prepare their heart, thou wilt cause thine ear to hear;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.10.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.10.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To judge the fatherless and the oppressed,\nThat man who is of the earth may be terrible no more.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "A prayer for the overthrow of the wicked.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
